    "text": "A cup of tea cools from <math><msup><mrow><mn>65.5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>&nbsp;o</mn></mrow></msup><mn>C</mn></math> to <math><msup><mrow><mn>62.5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>&nbsp;o</mn></mrow></msup><mn>C</mn></math> in <math> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>min</mtext> </mrow> </math> in a room at <math><msup><mrow><mn>22.5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>&nbsp;o</mn></mrow></msup><mn>C</mn></math>. How long will it take to cool from <math><msup><mrow><mn>46.5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>&nbsp;o</mn></mrow></msup><mn>C</mn></math> to <math><msup><mrow><mn>40.5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>&nbsp;o</mn></mrow></msup><mn>C</mn></math> in the same room?"
