  "solution": {
    "text": "According to Newton's law of cooling,<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>65.5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>62.5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>65.5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>62.5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>22.5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> .....(i)<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>46.5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>40.5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>46.5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>40.5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2